<SiteLayout title={"Blue Line Capital Group — Blue Line Capital Group"} description={"Un groupe diversifié réunissant entreprises, industrie et vision opérationnelle dans une perspective durable. Ancré à Douala. Ouvert sur l’avenir."} lang="fr">
<section class="hero"><div aria-hidden="true" class="hero-art"><img alt="" height="1000" src="/assets/img/hero-douala-concept.webp" width="1500"/></div><div class="hero-shade"></div><div class="shell hero-content"><div><div class="eyebrow"><span class="hairline"></span>00 / ANCR&Eacute; AU CAMEROUN. TOURN&Eacute; VERS L&rsquo;AVENIR.</div><h1>L&rsquo;entreprise, pens&eacute;e pour durer.</h1><p>Un groupe diversifi&eacute; r&eacute;unissant entreprises, industrie et vision op&eacute;rationnelle dans une perspective durable. Ancr&eacute; &agrave; Douala. Ouvert sur l&rsquo;avenir.</p><div class="hero-actions"><a class="btn btn-accent" href="/fr/businesses/"><span>Explorer les activit&eacute;s</span><span aria-hidden="true">&nearrow;</span></a><a class="btn btn-outline" href="/fr/contact/"><span>Entrer en contact</span><span aria-hidden="true">&nearrow;</span></a></div></div><div class="hero-aside"><div class="hero-small">A GROUP WITH A LONG VIEW</div><span>CM / 04&deg;03&prime; N &middot; 09&deg;42&prime; E</span></div></div><div class="hero-bottom shell"><span>DOUALA &middot; CAMEROON</span><span>SCROLL TO EXPLORE <b aria-hidden="true">&darr;</b></span></div></section><section class="intro section shell"><div class="intro-heading"><div class="eyebrow"><span class="hairline"></span>01 / Une vision de Groupe</div><h2>Le progr&egrave;s na&icirc;t de la compl&eacute;mentarit&eacute;.</h2></div><div class="intro-text"><p>De l&rsquo;immobilier &agrave; la construction, du commerce aux op&eacute;rations financi&egrave;res et &agrave; la technologie, nos activit&eacute;s sont reli&eacute;es par une conviction : des entreprises bien structur&eacute;es cr&eacute;ent une valeur durable.</p><a class="text-link" href="/fr/about/">Le Groupe <span aria-hidden="true">&nearrow;</span></a></div></section><section class="portfolio section"><div class="shell"><div class="section-intro"><div class="eyebrow"><span class="hairline"></span>02 / Domaines d&rsquo;activit&eacute;</div><div class="split-heading"><h2>Des m&eacute;tiers diff&eacute;rents. Une m&ecirc;me exigence.</h2><p>D&eacute;couvrez les secteurs et fonctions du Groupe. Chacun apporte son rythme, ses comp&eacute;tences et sa contribution &agrave; l&rsquo;ensemble.</p></div></div><div class="feature-tile"><a class="feature-img" href="/fr/businesses/blue-line-construction/"><img alt="Construction et infrastructures" class="" decoding="async" loading="lazy" src="/assets/img/construction-infrastructure.webp"/><span class="feature-image-overlay"></span><span class="feature-number">04 / 09</span></a><div class="feature-copy"><span class="small-label">FEATURED ACTIVITY / ACTIVIT&Eacute;</span><h3>Du plan &agrave; la r&eacute;alisation.</h3><p>La construction r&eacute;unit les m&eacute;tiers techniques, fournisseurs, entreprises et d&eacute;cisions quotidiennes dans des contraintes concr&egrave;tes. Blue Line Construction met l&rsquo;accent sur le pilotage, les achats, le suivi d&rsquo;avancement et la visibilit&eacute; des co&ucirc;ts. Les r&eacute;f&eacute;rences de projets n&eacute;cessitent des preuves v&eacute;rifiables.</p><a class="text-link" href="/fr/businesses/blue-line-construction/">D&eacute;couvrir l&rsquo;activit&eacute; &nearrow;</a></div></div><div class="sector-grid"><article class="sector-card" data-category="1"><a aria-label="D&eacute;couvrir cette activit&eacute; Blue Line Exchange (BLEX)" class="card-photo" href="/fr/businesses/blue-line-exchange/"><img alt="Change et tr&eacute;sorerie" class="card-photo-img" decoding="async" loading="lazy" src="/assets/img/exchange-market.webp"/><span class="card-photo-overlay"></span><span class="card-number">02 / 09</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="card-go">&nearrow;</span></a><div class="card-info"><span class="card-category">Change et tr&eacute;sorerie</span><h3><a href="/fr/businesses/blue-line-exchange/">Blue Line Exchange (BLEX)</a></h3><p>Des op&eacute;rations financi&egrave;res guid&eacute;es par la clart&eacute;, la rigueur et l&rsquo;information.</p><a class="text-link" href="/fr/businesses/blue-line-exchange/">D&eacute;couvrir l&rsquo;activit&eacute; <span aria-hidden="true">&nearrow;</span></a></div></article><article class="sector-card" data-category="2"><a aria-label="D&eacute;couvrir cette activit&eacute; Blue Line Property Management" class="card-photo" href="/fr/businesses/blue-line-property-management/"><img alt="Gestion immobili&egrave;re" class="card-photo-img" decoding="async" loading="lazy" src="/assets/img/property-architecture.webp"/><span class="card-photo-overlay"></span><span class="card-number">03 / 09</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="card-go">&nearrow;</span></a><div class="card-info"><span class="card-category">Gestion immobili&egrave;re</span><h3><a href="/fr/businesses/blue-line-property-management/">Blue Line Property Management</a></h3><p>Prendre soin des lieux o&ugrave; l&rsquo;on vit, travaille et construit l&rsquo;avenir.</p><a class="text-link" href="/fr/businesses/blue-line-property-management/">D&eacute;couvrir l&rsquo;activit&eacute; <span aria-hidden="true">&nearrow;</span></a></div></article><article class="sector-card" data-category="3"><a aria-label="D&eacute;couvrir cette activit&eacute; Blue Line Sugar Manufacturing" class="card-photo" href="/fr/businesses/blue-line-sugar-manufacturing/"><img alt="Production industrielle" class="card-photo-img" decoding="async" loading="lazy" src="/assets/img/sugar-manufacturing.webp"/><span class="card-photo-overlay"></span><span class="card-number">05 / 09</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="card-go">&nearrow;</span></a><div class="card-info"><span class="card-category">Production industrielle</span><h3><a href="/fr/businesses/blue-line-sugar-manufacturing/">Blue Line Sugar Manufacturing</a></h3><p>Une vision industrielle, de la mati&egrave;re premi&egrave;re au produit fini.</p><a class="text-link" href="/fr/businesses/blue-line-sugar-manufacturing/">D&eacute;couvrir l&rsquo;activit&eacute; <span aria-hidden="true">&nearrow;</span></a></div></article><article class="sector-card" data-category="3"><a aria-label="D&eacute;couvrir cette activit&eacute; Blue Line Importation, Assembly &amp; Trade" class="card-photo" href="/fr/businesses/blue-line-import-assembly-trade/"><img alt="Importation, assemblage et commerce" class="card-photo-img" decoding="async" loading="lazy" src="/assets/img/import-assembly-trade.webp"/><span class="card-photo-overlay"></span><span class="card-number">06 / 09</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="card-go">&nearrow;</span></a><div class="card-info"><span class="card-category">Importation, assemblage et commerce</span><h3><a href="/fr/businesses/blue-line-import-assembly-trade/">Blue Line Importation, Assembly &amp; Trade</a></h3><p>Relier origines, op&eacute;rations et march&eacute;s dans une cha&icirc;ne logistique int&eacute;gr&eacute;e.</p><a class="text-link" href="/fr/businesses/blue-line-import-assembly-trade/">D&eacute;couvrir l&rsquo;activit&eacute; <span aria-hidden="true">&nearrow;</span></a></div></article><article class="sector-card" data-category="4"><a aria-label="D&eacute;couvrir cette activit&eacute; HR &amp; Payroll" class="card-photo" href="/fr/businesses/hr-payroll/"><img alt="Ressources humaines" class="card-photo-img" decoding="async" loading="lazy" src="/assets/img/people-operations.webp"/><span class="card-photo-overlay"></span><span class="card-number">08 / 09</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="card-go">&nearrow;</span></a><div class="card-info"><span class="card-category">Ressources humaines</span><h3><a href="/fr/businesses/hr-payroll/">HR &amp; Payroll</a></h3><p>Offrir aux &eacute;quipes et aux op&eacute;rations une base fiable.</p><a class="text-link" href="/fr/businesses/hr-payroll/">D&eacute;couvrir l&rsquo;activit&eacute; <span aria-hidden="true">&nearrow;</span></a></div></article><article class="sector-card" data-category="4"><a aria-label="D&eacute;couvrir cette activit&eacute; Digital Transformation &amp; AI Copilot" class="card-photo" href="/fr/businesses/digital-transformation-ai/"><img alt="Transformation num&eacute;rique" class="card-photo-img" data-fallback="/assets/img/digital-intelligence.webp" decoding="async" loading="lazy" src="/assets/img/technology-workspace.webp"/><span class="card-photo-overlay"></span><span class="card-number">09 / 09</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="card-go">&nearrow;</span></a><div class="card-info"><span class="card-category">Transformation num&eacute;rique</span><h3><a href="/fr/businesses/digital-transformation-ai/">Digital Transformation &amp; AI Copilot</a></h3><p>Une meilleure information, des d&eacute;cisions connect&eacute;es, une technologie responsable.</p><a class="text-link" href="/fr/businesses/digital-transformation-ai/">D&eacute;couvrir l&rsquo;activit&eacute; <span aria-hidden="true">&nearrow;</span></a></div></article></div><div class="section-action"><a class="btn btn-accent" href="/fr/businesses/"><span>Voir tous les domaines</span><span aria-hidden="true">&nearrow;</span></a></div></div></section><section class="belief"><div class="belief-photo"><img alt="Architectural visual concept of coordinated structures" height="1000" src="/assets/img/approach-materials.webp" width="1500"/></div><div class="belief-text"><div class="eyebrow"><span class="hairline"></span>03 / THE BLUE LINE WAY</div><h2>De la rigueur aujourd&rsquo;hui. Des possibilit&eacute;s demain.</h2><p>Nous privil&eacute;gions le fond &agrave; l&rsquo;effet : comprendre le m&eacute;tier, mobiliser les &eacute;quipes et agir au-del&agrave; de la prochaine transaction.</p><a class="btn btn-outline" href="/fr/approach/"><span>Notre approche</span><span aria-hidden="true">&nearrow;</span></a></div></section><section class="values-section section shell"><div class="eyebrow"><span class="hairline"></span>04 / Ce qui nous rassemble</div><div class="values-grid"><article><span>01</span><h3>La clart&eacute; avant la complexit&eacute;</h3><p>Des priorit&eacute;s simples et une information fiable rendent la d&eacute;cision utile.</p></article><article><span>02</span><h3>La responsabilit&eacute; dans l&rsquo;ex&eacute;cution</h3><p>La gouvernance se traduit par la qualit&eacute; du travail quotidien.</p></article><article><span>03</span><h3>Les relations dans la dur&eacute;e</h3><p>La confiance se construit dans la constance des engagements.</p></article></div></section><section class="contact-strip"><div class="shell contact-strip-inner"><div class="eyebrow"><span class="hairline"></span>05 / CONNECT / &Eacute;CHANGE</div><h2>Tout commence par un &eacute;change.</h2><p>Pour les partenariats, pr&eacute;sentations et demandes institutionnelles, contactez Blue Line.</p><a class="btn btn-accent" href="/fr/contact/"><span>Contacter le Groupe</span><span aria-hidden="true">&nearrow;</span></a></div><span aria-hidden="true" class="huge-letter">B</span></section>
</SiteLayout>
